cted)\">F</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-8\" data-name=\"trade note section\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-8-1\" data-name=\"trade note title\">Trade note</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#151515]/70 p-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#d6d6d4]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-8-2\" data-name=\"trade note text\">Asia high and PDH swept at 09:31. 5m MSS at 09:44, filled the FVG at 3,512.40. Closed full at SSL instead of scaling at 2R.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-4 pb-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9\" data-name=\"attachments section\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-1\" data-name=\"attachments header row\"><h3 class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-1-1\" data-name=\"attachments title\">Attachments</h3><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-[#a2a2a0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-1-2\" data-name=\"add attachment button\"><i class=\"icon-paperclip text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-1-2-1\" data-name=\"paperclip icon\"></i>Add</span></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2\" data-name=\"attachments grid\">\n<div class=\"flex h-24 flex-col justify-end rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#151515] p-2 text-[11px] text-[#a2a2a0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2-1\" data-name=\"attachment card HTF chart\"><span class=\"mb-auto text-[16px] text-[#6f6f6d]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2-1-1\" data-name=\"attachment icon wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-image\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"image placeholder icon\"></i></span>HTF chart · 1H</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-24 flex-col justify-end rounded-md border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#151515] p-2 text-[11px] text-[#a2a2a0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2-2\" data-name=\"attachment card execution\"><span class=\"mb-auto text-[16px] text-[#6f6f6d]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2-2-1\" data-name=\"attachment icon wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-image\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-9-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"image placeholder icon\"></i></span>Execution · 5m</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-between border-t border-white/[0.07] px-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-5\" data-name=\"inspector footer\">\n<label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-[#d6d6d4]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1\"><span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-[3px] border border-white/[0.25]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1\"></span>Mark reviewed</label>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2\">\n<span class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-[15px] text-[#a2a2a0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1\"><i class=\"icon-trash-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-1-1\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-white/[0.12] bg-white/[0.04] px-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2\"><i class=\"icon-pencil text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2-2-1\"></i>Edit trade</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
