-10-29 <i class=\"icon-calendar text-[14px] text-[#a2a2a0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\"></i></div><div class=\"fm flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 px-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"exit time input\">10:36</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-4 gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"trade parameters grid\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"lots field group\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"lots label\">Lots</p><div class=\"fm flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 px-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"lots value input\">0.25</div></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"entry price field group\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"entry price label\">Entry price</p><div class=\"fm flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 px-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"entry price value input\">3512.40</div></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"exit price field group\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"exit price label\">Exit price</p><div class=\"fm flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 px-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-3-2\" data-name=\"exit price value input\">3500.20</div></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-4\" data-name=\"fees field group\"><p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-4-1\" data-name=\"fees label\">Fees ($)</p><div class=\"fm flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 px-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-4-2\" data-