p><p class=\"fm mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#d6d6d4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"risk stat value\">$125.00</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"gross pnl stat group\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"gross pnl label\">Gross P&amp;L</p><p class=\"fm mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#3ddc84]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"gross pnl value\">+$305.00</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-3\" data-name=\"fees stat group\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"fees stat label\">Fees</p><p class=\"fm mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#d6d6d4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-3-2\" data-name=\"fees stat value\">−$1.75</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-4\" data-name=\"net pnl stat group\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-4-1\" data-name=\"net pnl stat label\">Net P&amp;L</p><p class=\"fm mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#3ddc84]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-4-2\" data-name=\"net pnl value\">+$303.25</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-5\" data-name=\"planned r stat group\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-5-1\" data-name=\"planned r label\">Planned R</p><p class=\"fm mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#d6d6d4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-5-2\" data-name=\"planned r value\">2.88R</p></div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-6\" data-name=\"realized r stat group\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-6-1\" data-name=\"realized r label\">Realized R</p><p class=\"fm mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#3ddc84]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-6-2\" data-name=\"realized r value\">+2.44R</p></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"fm mt-2 text-[11px] text-[#6f6f6d]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"instrument tick info caption\">XAUUSD · tick 0.01 · $1.00 per tick per lot</p>\n<div class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6\" data-name=\"playbook field group\">\n<p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-1\" data-name=\"playbook label\">Playbook</p>\n<div class=\"flex h-10 items-center justify-between rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 px-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-2\" data-name=\"playbook selector row\"><span data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-2-1\" data-name=\"playbook selected value\"><span class=\"fm mr-2 text-[12px] text-[#e50914]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-2-1-1\" data-name=\"playbook tag badge A\">A</span>Sell-side raid reversal</span><i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[14px] text-[#a2a2a0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-2-2\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7\" data-name=\"trade note field group\">\n<p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider text-[#a2a2a0] uppercase\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7-1\" data-name=\"trade note label\">Trade note</p>\n<div class=\"min-h-24 rounded-md border border-white/[0.09] bg-[#151515]/80 p-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#e8e8e6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7-2\" data-name=\"trade note text area\">Asia high and PDH swept at 09:31. 5m MSS at 09:44, filled the FVG at 3,512.40. Closed full at SSL instead of scaling at 2R.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex h-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-end gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.07] px-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"modal footer action bar\">\n<span class=\"flex h-10 items-center rounded-md border border-white/[0.1] bg-white/[0.03] px-4 text-[13px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"cancel button\">Cancel</span>\n<span class=\"flex h-10 items-center rounded-md bg-[#e50914] px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_10px_24px_-12px_rgba(229,9,20,0.9)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"save changes primary button\">Save changes</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
